{
  "id": "section-896",
  "title": "关于宜宾问题的批示",
  "level": 0,
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-276.htm",
  "html": "<table><tbody><tr><td> -&gt;  -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》</a><hr>\n<b>276)</b>\n\n\n<br>\n<br>\n　　许多外地学生，几次冲入中南海，一些军事院校冲进国防部，中央和军委并没有指责他们，更没有让他们认罪，悔过，或者写检讨，讲清楚，让他们回去就行了，而各地把冲军事机关一事，却看得太重了。<br><br><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-275.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">上一页</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">目录</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-277.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下一页</a><br><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n"
}
